.TH FOREST-SETTINGS 1 "October 2026" "forest" "Forest desktop environment"
.SH NAME
forest-settings \- Forest settings application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B forest-settings
.RI [ path ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B forest-settings
is the standalone settings application for the Forest desktop
environment. It loads every settings plugin in
.I /usr/lib/forest/settings
and lists their pages by category in a sidebar tree. It
is styled using the active Forest theme's
.IR settings.css .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I path
Page to open, e.g.
.B desktop/panel
or
.BR appearance/wallpaper .
A category ID such as
.B appearance
opens its first page. Without a path, or with an unknown one, the
About page opens.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR forest (1)
